#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizer run of the graphics tests (ci.sh, with the noclose.c shim).
# Only leaks in third-party libraries that the engine can't free. One per line, with where it was seen.

# libX11 21.x through SDL 3.4 (X11 window title as a text property): 14 bytes per UTF-8 window title.
leak:_Xutf8TextListToTextProperty
